  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.<br>• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Stir in jasmine rice, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.<br>• Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 mins. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69311a6d8a52ddcac84ce4b7/step-6c935400.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.<br>• Thinly slice cucumber into rounds. Thinly slice spring onion (see ingredients).<br>• In a small bowl, combine teriyaki seasoning, the chilli flakes (if using), soy sauce, water (for the sauce) and honey. Set aside.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69311a6d8a52ddcac84ce4b7/step-0b025710.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When the rice has 5 mins remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.<br>• Cook tofu, tossing, until browned, 3-4 mins.<br>• Reduce heat to medium, stir in teriyaki sauce mixture and cook until bubbling, 1-2 mins. Toss to coat.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69311a6d8a52ddcac84ce4b7/step-609c7420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a medium bowl, combine salad leaves, cucumber and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.<br>• Divide garlic rice and cucumber salad between bowls.<br>• Top with saucy teriyaki tofu. Spoon over any remaining glaze from pan. Drizzle with the mayonnaise and garnish with spring onion to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69311a6d8a52ddcac84ce4b7/step-80ebab30.jpg"
    }
  ]
